OL,3,GNEWSAThe two MHKs vying to be the next
OL,4,Achief minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are two candidates in the running
OL,7,Fto be the Isle of Man's next chief
OL,8,Fminister, with a chance for history to
OL,9,Fbe made in Manx politics.
OL,11,FDouglas Central member Chris Thomas and
OL,12,FRushen member Kirrie Jenkins are both
OL,13,Fcandidates for the top job in Tynwald.
OL,15,FMembers will vote in the historic
OL,16,Fparliament on 13 October for their
OL,17,Fpreferred candidate.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
