OL,3,GNEWSAThe two MHKs vying to be the next
OL,4,Achief minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FThomas has been a member of the House
OL,7,Fof Keys since 2013, while Jenkins would
OL,8,Fmake history if elected, as not only
OL,9,Fthe first chief minister as a
OL,10,Ffirst-time MHK, but as the island's
OL,11,Ffirst female chief.
